# Allowlist build context: the image build needs exactly what
# `cargo build --release --locked --bin toolu-runner` needs. Everything
# else (git history, docs, target/, CI, the rest of scripts/) stays out so
# context uploads are small and unrelated edits never bust the build cache.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
crates/**/target/
# The `docker` target's entrypoint. One file, not `!scripts/`: everything else
# under scripts/ is release tooling that would bust the image cache on every
# edit without ever entering the build.
!scripts/docker-entrypoint.sh
